There are several sprintf calls which could overflow buffers. Replace
them with snprintf for safety, and fix strncpy calls to correctly
specify the buffer length as the copy limit.

Bug: 511632970
Test: TODO
Flag: EXEMPT BUGFIX
Change-Id: I3f12e32677d841392e3798784c311dc8c3caff77
(cherry picked from commit 513ef72f4e38b7f9b6c74f5784a61fb928ff8cc0)

