+From 57a4425825e61e01c59b004f74936cf37538ae9f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: Paul Moy <pmoy@google.com>
+Date: Fri, 12 Jun 2026 20:16:08 +0000
+Subject: [PATCH] Fix sprintf and strncpy usage
+
+There are several sprintf calls which could overflow buffers. Replace
+them with snprintf for safety, and fix strncpy calls to correctly
+specify the buffer length as the copy limit.
+
+Bug: 511632970
+Test: TODO
+Flag: EXEMPT BUGFIX
+Change-Id: I3f12e32677d841392e3798784c311dc8c3caff77
+---
+ prnt/hpps/hppsfilter.c | 82 +++++++++++++++++++++++++-----------------
+ 1 file changed, 50 insertions(+), 32 deletions(-)
+
+diff --git a/prnt/hpps/hppsfilter.c b/prnt/hpps/hppsfilter.c
